00:01:16.579 --> 00:01:27.959
The only possible explanation I could come
up with, is that Luffy is able to imitate

00:01:27.959 --> 00:01:32.849
other devil fruit abilities, which would of
course be awesome, but I think there might

00:01:32.849 --> 00:01:37.990
be a completely different twist here after
all.

00:01:37.990 --> 00:01:47.520
WHat's up, I'm Manu, and the user with the
