00:03:27.760 --> 00:03:33.920
The sun is fire, Luffy is the sun god, so
having fire ability makes sense.

00:03:33.920 --> 00:03:38.569
Only that as far as his powers have been explained
so far, it doesn't.

00:03:38.569 --> 00:03:43.480
Oda has focused so much on the gomu gomu sun
god nike devil fruit story line in the last

00:03:43.480 --> 00:03:48.799
few dozen chapters, setting up this reveal,
that it was very easy to overlook the importance

00:03:48.799 --> 00:03:55.620
of another big chunk of lore drop: The introduction
of King's lunarian race.

00:03:55.620 --> 00:04:04.010
Here's a quick recap: Lunarians are a race
of powerful beings with unique abilities,

00:04:04.010 --> 00:04:06.810
that used to live on top of the red line.

00:04:06.810 --> 00:04:12.689
Despite their incredible strength, the Lunarians
were somehow driven into almost-extinction,

00:04:12.689 --> 00:04:16.549
with king being the last known remnant.

00:04:16.549 --> 00:04:21.709
Based on kings appearance, lunarians seem
to be almost angel like beings, they are humans

00:04:21.709 --> 00:04:26.210
with dark black wings, way larger than those
of the other known sky people.

00:04:26.210 --> 00:04:31.599
Especially through the lens of Oda-sensei's
love for quirky characters, King is probably

00:04:31.599 --> 00:04:38.780
the most objectively handsome and perfect
looking Male figure in the story, with long

00:04:38.780 --> 00:04:45.340
white hair and dark skin, making it a point
of presenting Lunarians as a elf-like or angel-like

00:04:45.340 --> 00:04:55.590
race, that was almost completely eradicated
for their powers.

00:04:55.590 --> 00:05:02.490
Now, Interestingly enough the name lunarian
hints at a connection to the moon, which is

00:05:02.490 --> 00:05:07.419
not only interesting because of Enel's adventures
on the moon and all the lore that seems to

00:05:07.419 --> 00:05:12.650
be hidden up there, but also because the sun
and the moon are the two main occurring symbols

00:05:12.650 --> 00:05:13.840
in the story.

00:05:13.840 --> 00:05:20.370
On top of that, King has a face tattoo, not
unlike that of Luffy's father dragon, that

00:05:20.370 --> 00:05:24.110
seems to depict a flower known as moonwort.

00:05:24.110 --> 00:05:29.599
That parallel to dragon by the way would not
only make luffy half sun and half moon, but

00:05:29.599 --> 00:05:36.229
also begs the question to wether it was Luffy's
mother or maybe even dragon himself who is

00:05:36.229 --> 00:05:37.229
lunarian.

00:05:37.229 --> 00:05:43.250
Who knows, maybe god valley was actually the
last refuge of the lunarian race until the

00:05:43.250 --> 00:05:47.680
god valley incident happened.

00:05:47.680 --> 00:05:55.270
Because, not only were the Lunarians known
as gods themselves, connecting them to Luffy's

00:05:55.270 --> 00:06:01.390
sun god title, but they are also naturally
able to produce and manipulate flames with

00:06:01.390 --> 00:06:06.780
their body, similar to how the minks are able
to generate electricity or the fish man to

00:06:06.780 --> 00:06:19.270
manipulate water.

00:06:19.270 --> 00:06:25.759
Which of course brings me back to Luffy and
his strange ability to create fire, long before

00:06:25.759 --> 00:06:27.490
awakening his Nika devil fruit.

00:06:27.490 --> 00:06:34.630
All this lore drop happened at the same time
as the hints that Luffy's devil fruit might

00:06:34.630 --> 00:06:36.000
be special.

00:06:36.000 --> 00:06:40.780
Why give us this backstory now, before Luffy's
defeat and reawakening?

00:06:40.780 --> 00:06:45.770
Why specifically show us King's background
and not that of Queen or Jack?

00:06:45.770 --> 00:06:50.479
We find out that The World Government seemingly
hunts Lunarians around the world to this day,

00:06:50.479 --> 00:06:59.229
rewarding anyone with 100,000,000 Berries
for any tip-off about a Lunarian's whereabouts,

00:06:59.229 --> 00:07:03.400
at the same time that we learn that they were
trying to get their hands on the Nika devil

00:07:03.400 --> 00:07:06.080
fruit for 800 years.

00:07:06.080 --> 00:07:12.509
So to me, that suggests, that this is either
related to Luffy himself, or even more specifically

00:07:12.509 --> 00:07:19.569
to the Nika fruit.

00:07:19.569 --> 00:07:25.500
And who knowns, maybe the infamous D initial
was actually used for descendants of the lunarian

00:07:25.500 --> 00:07:31.449
race, kept secret to not reveal its continued
existence to the world government.

00:07:31.449 --> 00:07:32.449
Just a thought.

00:07:32.449 --> 00:07:39.300
Luffy being part lunarian would not only explain
his fire powers, but also how he was able

00:07:39.300 --> 00:07:45.220
to generate enough heat to awaken his devil
fruit powers, as we saw him melting and steaming

00:07:45.220 --> 00:07:47.800
at the end of chapter 1043.

00:07:47.800 --> 00:07:53.050
What I'm trying to say here, is that being
Lunarian might be a pre-requisite for awakening

00:07:53.050 --> 00:07:54.770
the Nika fruit's powers.

00:07:54.770 --> 00:07:59.009
Which would not only explain why the government
would try to kill off every single member

00:07:59.009 --> 00:08:04.229
of their race, but also why they were not
concerned with luffy having the fruit, as

00:08:04.229 --> 00:08:06.950
they didn't know he had lunarian blood.

00:08:06.950 --> 00:08:16.510
Step one, be part lunarian.

00:08:16.510 --> 00:08:20.389
Part two have the sun god fruit.

00:08:20.389 --> 00:08:23.759
Part three be worthy to awaken its powers.

00:08:23.759 --> 00:08:27.580
Part four, subscribe to the channel.

00:08:27.580 --> 00:08:32.960
Another really interesting detail that supports
this idea is Luffy's eyebrows looking a lot

00:08:32.960 --> 00:08:35.660
like Sanji's in chapter 1044.

00:08:35.660 --> 00:08:41.950
Sanji who's fire powers have now also been
strongly hinted at being based on Lunarian

00:08:41.950 --> 00:08:42.950
dna.

00:08:42.950 --> 00:08:48.000
Who we now see using blue flames, like hyogoro's
in the latest cover.

00:08:48.000 --> 00:08:53.940
And who I want to add, was the very first
person to notice Luffy's reawakening before

00:08:53.940 --> 00:08:59.700
anyone else, despite probably not having better
observation haki than for example Marco.

00:08:59.700 --> 00:09:04.020
On top of that, we have Luffy's haki taking
on the form of flames as well.

00:09:04.020 --> 00:09:08.280
There were also a ton of other interesting
instances throughout the story, that now that

00:09:08.280 --> 00:09:11.230
I look at them again, might be a lot more
important.

00:09:11.230 --> 00:09:16.210
For example Luffy not freezing on drum island,
and arc by the way that literally connected

00:09:16.210 --> 00:09:24.710
the drums of liberation, the will of D and
the Hito Hito no mi.

00:09:24.710 --> 00:09:38.370
Luffy was also literally frozen solid by Aokiji,
but was completely fine.

00:09:38.370 --> 00:09:43.160
And luffy generating more heat and steam the
more air he inhales also would work really

00:09:43.160 --> 00:09:45.160
well with innate fire powers.

00:09:45.160 --> 00:09:50.830
In fact, this would also fit in very nicely
with the idea that devil fruits have a will

00:09:50.830 --> 00:09:51.850
of their own.

00:09:51.850 --> 00:09:56.770
It's one of the theories I am most proud of,
because it seems to be confirmed more and

00:09:56.770 --> 00:09:57.790
more every chapter.

00:09:57.790 --> 00:10:03.340
So, if you want to take this to the next level,
don'T ignore this video here.

